1
00:00:00,897 --> 00:00:03,647
(Sheldon:)Yes, hello.
Uh, this is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

2
00:00:03,816 --> 00:00:06,696
(Sheldon:)I'm at 2311
North Los Robles Avenue.

3
00:00:06,861 --> 00:00:09,571
(Sheldon:)I'd like to report
a dangerous wild animal.

4
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:11,369
(Sheldon:)A blue jay.

5
00:00:12,992 --> 00:00:17,372
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, this is Animal Control.
I don't understand the laughter.

6
00:00:17,538 --> 00:00:19,288
(Sheldon:)No, the bird is not in my home.

7
00:00:19,499 --> 00:00:23,339
(Sheldon:)If he was in my home,
I obviously would've called 911.

8
00:00:24,003 --> 00:00:26,673
(Sheldon:)I have no doubt that there are things
that you're frightened of.

9
00:00:26,839 --> 00:00:29,839
Uh, being stuck in a dead-end
public service job.

10
00:00:30,009 --> 00:00:31,679
(Sheldon:)Or your wife stepping out on you...

11
00:00:31,844 --> 00:00:34,634
(Sheldon:)...because you're stuck
in a dead-end public service job.

12
00:00:34,806 --> 00:00:36,936
(Sheldon:)Or spiders.

13
00:00:37,517 --> 00:00:40,647
(Sheldon:)Don't you think
I tried making cat noises?

14
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,440
(Leonard(returning in a tee shirt and backwards cap):)Too casual?

15
00:00:48,069 --> 00:00:50,239
(Sheldon:)For an audience with the Queen, yes.

